    "text": "theforgottensouth.com\nwebsite\nSaluda County, South Carolina\nUncovering the Hidden Story of Pine Grove School\n4 hours ago\n**This school is on private property and under surveillance. Do Not Trespass Here**. On a quiet back road in Saluda County, South Carolina, an aging wooden structure slowly fades into the landscape, surrendering to time and the elements. Most who pass by might not realize the significance of the building or what it once stood for, because its stories seem to have been mostly lost.",
